{"title":"Deerhide Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Hill Giant Youth, Boar, Skeleton, Antlion Pitling, Sand Jackal</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 5 · DEX 20 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-youth\" title=\"Hill Giant Youth - Normal, 0.8% of recorded drops (1 / 129 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/969fc0f03105396b9256.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.8%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"boar\" title=\"Boar - Normal, 1.3% of recorded drops (1 / 77 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7731346cea2e7cf972b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Boar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 207 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"antlion-pitling\" title=\"Antlion Pitling - Normal, 0.9% of recorded drops (1 / 111 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/922f1f2a8e0dca1a9c52.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Pitling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.9%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-jackal\" title=\"Sand Jackal - Normal, 0.9% of recorded